# ******************************************************************
# * File         : .env.example
# * Application  : CardDemo
# * Type         : Environment variable template
# * Function     : Documents every externalised setting the application and the
# *                local Docker Compose topology consume. This file is a
# *                TEMPLATE ONLY and contains NO real secret. Copy it to `.env`
# *                (which is git-ignored) and fill in real values locally.
# *                The JWT signing key is environment-indirected with no
# *                committed default so the application fails fast when it is
# *                absent; the ten seeded users from app/jcl/DUSRSECJ.jcl carry
# *                the literal plaintext password PASSWORD in the legacy corpus
# *                and are stored only as BCrypt hashes in the target.
